				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7f6cca4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7f6cca4" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>Please note that while all voters are able to vote in November, <b>you must be enrolled in the Democratic Party to vote in the June 25 Democratic Primary.</b></p>						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
